r layer. They are trained by adjusting output weights. No relevant arXiv papers found for echo state networks in anomaly detection.","role":"assistant"},"model":"qwen2.5:7b","prompt_eval_count":1060,"prompt_eval_duration":45225000,"total_duration":2600540000}}